DESCRIPTION:Roll up\, roll up! The punk circus of your craziest dreams is c
 oming to town. Live and direct from the underground party scene comes Cirq
 ue Le Strange by Oozing Future. This unforgettable collection of carnies a
 nd queers has to be seen to believed! Featuring surreal and unusual acts t
 hat test the limits of the human body\, this show is like nothing you’ve
  ever seen before. Meet the King of the Freaks – world-famous body modif
 ication star The Lizardman\, as seen on Ripley’s Believe it or Not! See 
 the bendiest woman in the southern hemisphere\, queen of contortion Solian
 a Ersie! Catch punk clown Captain Ruin creating mischief and mayhem\, befo
 re hanging weights off his private parts! See gender-bending draglesque cr
 eature Winter Greene\, winner of Mx Burlesque Victoria 2025! And watch in 
 awe as pole dancing siren Thembot entrances you with erotic skill and stre
 ngth. All this and more is ready to hit the road and explode on stage in a
  town near you. With ten stops on our first national tour\, this is your c
 hance to join the freaks for a truly surreal night out at the punk circus!
